+
+# Summarizer Subagent
+
+A specialized subagent for generating summaries and extracting key information from documents.
+
+## Purpose
+
+The Summarizer subagent takes document content and produces:
+1. A concise summary (3-5 bullet points)
+2. Key entities (people, organizations, dates, topics)
+3. Document classification (policy, technical, guide, etc.)
+
+## When to Delegate
+
+Use this subagent when you need to:
+- Quickly understand a document's content
+- Extract the main points from a long document
+- Identify key entities for metadata enrichment
+- Classify document type for organization
+
+## Invocation
+
+```
+Delegate to the summarizer subagent:
+
+Document Title: [title]
+Document Content:
+[paste content here]
+
+Please provide:
+1. Summary (3-5 bullets)
+2. Key entities
+3. Document type classification
+```
+
+## Input Format
+
+The subagent expects:
+- **title**: Document title or filename
+- **content**: Full text content (up to 50,000 chars)
+- **context** (optional): Additional context about the document source
+
+## Output Format
+
+```json
+{
+  "summary": {
+    "bullets": [
+      "Main point 1",
+      "Main point 2",
+      "Main point 3"
+    ],
+    "one_liner": "Brief one-sentence summary"
+  },
+  "entities": {
+    "people": ["John Smith", "Jane Doe"],
+    "organizations": ["Acme Corp", "HR Department"],
+    "dates": ["2024-01-01", "Q4 2024"],
+    "topics": ["vacation policy", "benefits", "PTO"]
+  },
+  "classification": {
+    "type": "policy",
+    "confidence": 0.95,
+    "subcategory": "HR Policy"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+## Example Usage
+
+**Input**:
+```
+Delegate to the summarizer subagent:
+
+Document Title: Employee Vacation Policy 2024
+Document Content:
+# Vacation Policy
+
+## Overview
+All full-time employees are entitled to paid time off (PTO)
+based on their years of service...
+
+[continued content]
+```
+
+**Output**:
+```
+Summary:
+- Full-time employees receive 15-25 PTO days based on tenure
+- PTO requests require 2 weeks advance notice for 3+ days
+- Unused PTO carries over up to 5 days maximum
+- Manager approval required for all time off requests
+- Blackout periods exist during Q4 close
+
+Key Entities:
+- Organizations: HR Department, Management
+- Topics: PTO, vacation, time off, benefits
+- Dates: Annual review, Q4
+
+Classification: HR Policy (confidence: 0.98)
+```
+
+## Configuration
+
+| Parameter | Value | Description |
+|-----------|-------|-------------|
+| model | claude-sonnet-4-20250514 | Fast, accurate for summaries |
+| temperature | 0.3 | Low for consistency |
+| max_tokens | 2000 | Sufficient for detailed output |
+
+## Integration Points
+
+- **Document Processor Skill**: Receives content from document processing
+- **Session 5 Pipeline**: Provides metadata for chunk enrichment
+- **Session 6 RAG**: Summaries used for context assembly
+- **Session 9 Memory**: Summaries stored for quick retrieval
+
+## Best Practices
+
+1. **Chunk large documents**: For documents over 50K chars, process in sections
+2. **Provide context**: Include source information for better classification
+3. **Validate entities**: Review extracted entities for accuracy
+4. **Use summaries wisely**: Great for overviews, but retain full content for search
